libeno
------------------------------------------
C reference parsing library for eno notation

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libeno-devel-0.1.0-1bl4
  libeno0-0.1.0-1bl4
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libicu76-76.1-2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://codeberg.org/simonrepp/libeno

Canonical download:
  https://codeberg.org/simonrepp/libeno/archive/0.1.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libeno-0.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libeno-0.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libeno-0.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeno-0.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeno0-0.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libeno-devel-0.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libeno)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libeno.README
  /usr/share/doc/libeno/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/libeno/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/libeno/README.md

(libeno0)
  /usr/bin/cygeno-0.dll

(libeno-devel)
  /usr/include/eno.h
  /usr/lib/libeno.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/eno.pc

------------------

